anguozhi-053-zhanghong:line016-pei01-01:m0016","quote":"楚武王"}]},{"id":"1l4_2pq_e7w_A","label":"熊貲（楚文王）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"文王熊貲","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0284"]},{"surface":"文王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0000"]},{"surface":"文","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0030"]},{"surface":"楚王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0014"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0284","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p013","quote":"文王熊貲"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p014","quote":"文王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p097","quote":"文"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p014","quote":"楚王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p013","quote":"武王十七年，晉之曲沃莊伯弒主國晉孝侯。十九年，鄭伯弟段作亂。二十一年，鄭侵天子之田。二十三年，衞弒其君桓公。二十九年，魯弒其君隱公。三十一年，宋太宰華督弒其君殤公。三十五年，楚伐隨。隨曰：「我無罪。」楚曰：「我蠻夷也。今諸侯皆爲叛相侵，或相殺。我有敝甲，欲以觀中國之政，請王室尊吾號。」隨人爲之周，請尊楚，王室不聽，還報楚。三十七年，楚熊通怒曰：「吾先鬻熊，文王之師也，蚤終。成王舉我先公，乃以子男田令居楚，蠻夷皆率服，而王不加位，我自尊耳。」乃自立爲武王，與隨人盟而去。於是始開濮地而有之。五十一年，周召隨侯，數以立楚爲王。楚怒，以隨背己，伐隨。武王卒師中而兵罷。子文王熊貲立，始都郢。","source_term":"武王","term_role":"literal_person_anchor_in_relation_context","interpretation_note":"原關係主張的source_term是合述描述；此欄保留本段實際人物錨點。關係及完整證據見source_assertion_id。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji040-031","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w"}},{"id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAA","label":"熊眴（蚡冒）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"熊眴","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m011-0008"]},{"surface":"蚡冒"