chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蚡冒","kind":"person","person_id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"蚡冒","kind":"person","person_id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"蚡冒","kind":"person","person_id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"熊通","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"蚡冒","kind":"person","person_id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"ymr_gcs_kii_DAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m012-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"楚武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p013","text":"武王十七年，晉之曲沃莊伯弒主國晉孝侯。十九年，鄭伯弟段作亂。二十一年，鄭侵天子之田。二十三年，衞弒其君桓公。二十九年，魯弒其君隱公。三十一年，宋太宰華督弒其君殤公。三十五年，楚伐隨。隨曰：「我無罪。」楚曰：「我蠻夷也。今諸侯皆爲叛相侵，或相殺。我有敝甲，欲以觀中國之政，請王室尊吾號。」隨人爲之周，請尊楚，王室不聽，還報楚。三十七年，楚熊通怒曰：「吾先鬻熊，文王之師也，蚤終。成王舉我先公，乃以子男田令居楚，蠻夷皆率服，而王不加位，我自尊耳。」乃自立爲武王，與隨人盟而去。於是始開濮地而有之。五十一年，周召隨侯，數以立楚爲王。楚怒，以隨背己，伐隨。武王卒師中而兵罷。子文王熊貲立，始都郢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0008","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"di1_tea_bkj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"晉孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"eqp_oer_tei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"鄭伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"段之兄鄭伯的國君稱尚待與他篇事件核對，不由常見世系補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"弟段","kind":"person","person_id":"tsu_wyg_g69","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"kwa_ew6_bz3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"隱公","kind":"person","person_id":"h0m_56l_zq0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"華督","kind":"person","person_id":"2ps_uom_6ah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"ac8_u5v_dxj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"熊通","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"鬻熊","kind":"person","person_id":"dhq_jrq_2tw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0253","start":253,"end":255,"surface":"隨侯","kind":"person","person_id":"le6_hlz_o1r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0284","start":284,"end":288,"surface":"文王熊貲","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p097","text":"鬻熊之嗣，周封於楚。僻在荊蠻，蓽路藍縷。及通而霸，僭號曰武。文旣伐申，成亦赦許。子圉篡嫡，商臣殺父。天禍未悔，憑奸自怙。昭困奔亡，懷迫囚虜。頃襄、考烈，祚衰南土。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鬻熊","kind":"person","person_id":"dhq_jrq_2tw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"前次為未定短稱；本次依正文事件或明示王號暫接，仍待附載層版本與人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"1l4_2pq_e7w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"前次為未定短稱；本次依正文事件或明示王號暫接，仍待附載層版本與人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"osu_yvw_bwr","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"前次為未定短稱；本次依正文事件或明示王號暫接，仍待附載層版本與人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"子圉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"索隱述贊中的短稱或疑名，未以正文同字或常見君系強接；須核附載層版本與指代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"商臣","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"父","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"述贊商臣殺父的父稱，尚須與正文圍成王、成王自絞記載核人物與死亡說法，不因附載語直接指定來源優先。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"昭","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3_AEA","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"前次為未定短稱；本次依正